      "total_steps": 5,
      "concept": "Recursion & Trees",
      "narration": "Let's make sure we have this down before writing the full loop. Since our target is 23 and array[mid] is 16 (so target > array[mid]), how must we update our search bounds for the next round?",
      "board_commands": [
        {
